# command_the_stage.txt:6-8: at each upkeep, if an opponent was dealt noncombat
# damage last turn (X = PlayerCountOpponents$HasProperty
# wasDealtNonCombatDamageLastTurn, PlayerProperty.java:140-175), the card
# returns from the graveyard to its owner's hand. human bolts the ai in turn 1
# (3 noncombat damage); when turn 2's upkeep begins "last turn" is turn 1.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
queue targets ai
castspell human 1
resolvestack
advance 11
passpriority
